<p>Conjures <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 2, 2, 2, 3</acronym> missile-shaped rocks that you target individually at any target or targets in range.  Each missile deals <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">60, 81, 98, 111, 124</acronym> physical damage, and an additional <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">10, 14, 16, 19, 21</acronym> bleeding damage every turn for 5 turns.</p><p>At talent level 5, you can conjure one additional missile.</p><p>The damage will increase with your Spellpower.</p>